So I'd suggest "blotriaxti" (probably not so pretty), or a stage-4=20
"iaxti" (the final i is taken from bloti). Of course, Jacht means hunt=20
(n), but the purpose of Jachts have shifted and are indeed more about=20
luxury and leisure or about racing nowadays(and who knows what else).

